    "body": "## Summary\n- Syncs current repository memory after PR #407 integrated selector inventory revision 20261001.1.\n- Updates PROJECT_MEMORY.md, .ai-memory/CURRENT.md, CANON.md, WORKFLOWS.md, TASKS.md, and the two inventory task STATE files.\n- Records the accepted 8-model / 44-pair inventory, stable capability floor ranks, official cost source, merge SHA, validation, and baseline-only validator failures.\n- Adds one compact completed-cycle archive entry.\n- No runtime, gameplay, selector, or product files are changed.\n\nMemory revision: 2026-10-01-1945-JST-R8\nInventory PR #407 merge: 4cd05ac81584003e44f31a265d3a389350bc5ddb\n\n## Validation\n- Repository policy validator: PASS_REPOSITORY_POLICY\n- git diff --check: PASS\n- validate_ai_work_pipeline.py: unchanged baseline failures in unrelated July 2026 task records; new terminal inventory task states are recognized by the validator.",
